            "text": "cutting-edge technologies in robotics include soft robots, swarm robotics, humanoid robots, autonomous robots, wearable robots, and brain-computer interfaces.",
            "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
            "id": "1",
            "text": "ethics boards or committees are established to review and assess the potential ethical implications of research projects or products before they are released into the market.",
            "event": "ADD"
